    <section xml:id="sec-section-3-2">
      <title>Section 22 - Identifying Quadric Surfaces</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Recognize a quadric surface and sketch an ellipsoid.</li>
    <li>
      Identify the equation or traces of a hyperboloid of one or two sheets or an elliptic cone.
    </li>
    <li>
      Identify the equation or traces of an elliptic paraboloid or hyperbolic paraboloid.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

      <p>[Placeholder]</p>
